│ outcomes among patients with acute renal failure treated with CA hemodialysis membranes and those treated with PS    │
│ membranes were not significantly different. The observed advantage favoring renal recovery among this ICU population │
│ treated with CA hemodialysis membranes warrants further investigation."}, {"study_index": 9, "title": "Influence of  │
│ dialysis membranes on outcomes in acute renal failure: a meta‐analysis", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Considerable        │
│ controversy exists as to whether synthetic (more biocompatible) dialysis membranes improve outcome in patients with  │
│ acute renal failure (ARF) compared to cellulose-based membranes. Numerous trials conducted have yielded inconsistent │
